---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout bodyClass="font-serif">
  <div
    class="relative flex min-h-screen w-full flex-col overflow-x-hidden border-[12px] border-primary"
  >
    <!-- Header -->
    <header
      class="flex items-center justify-between border-b-2 border-primary bg-background-light px-8 py-4"
    >
      <div class="flex items-center gap-6">
        <div class="flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-4xl">menu_book</span>
          <h1
            class="font-display text-3xl font-black tracking-tighter uppercase"
          >
            The Tome: 1970 Edition
          </h1>
        </div>
        <nav
          class="hidden md:flex items-center gap-6 font-display font-bold uppercase text-sm tracking-widest"
        >
          <a class="hover:underline" href="#">Classes</a>
          <a class="hover:underline" href="#">Spells</a>
          <a class="hover:underline" href="#">Bestiary</a>
          <a class="hover:underline" href="#">Relics</a>
        </nav>
      </div>
      <div class="flex items-center gap-4">
        <div
          class="border-2 border-primary px-2 py-1 flex items-center bg-white/50"
        >
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-xl">search</span>
          <input
            class="bg-transparent border-none focus:ring-0 font-mono text-xs uppercase w-32"
            placeholder="QUERY INDEX..."
            type="text"
          />
        </div>
        <span class="font-mono text-xs font-bold">VOL. IV</span>
        <button
          class="flex items-center gap-2 bg-primary text-background-light px-4 py-1.5 font-display font-bold uppercase text-sm tracking-widest hover:bg-primary/90 transition-colors"
        >
          <span>Exit</span>
          <span class="material-symbols-outlined text-lg">logout</span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </header>
    <div class="flex flex-1 flex-col lg:flex-row">
      <!-- Main Content (Multi-column Magazine Layout) -->
      <main
        class="flex-1 p-0 grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-12 overflow-hidden bg-background-light"
      >
        <!-- Hero Title Slab -->
        <div
          class="col-span-12 border-b-2 border-primary p-8 flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end gap-4 bg-white/20"
        >
          <div>
            <h2
              class="font-mono text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.3em] mb-2 opacity-70"
            >
              Classification: Martial / Necrotic
            </h2>
            <h1
              class="font-display text-7xl md:text-9xl font-black leading-none tracking-tighter uppercase"
            >
              Dread Knight
            </h1>
          </div>
          <div class="text-right max-w-xs">
            <p class="font-serif italic text-xl leading-tight">
              "A marrow-chilling class of eternal servitude, bound by black iron
              and blood oaths."
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Illustration Column -->
        <div
          class="col-span-12 md:col-span-5 border-r-2 border-primary p-0 bg-white"
        >
          <div
            class="h-full w-full min-h-[500px] bg-center bg-no-repeat bg-cover grayscale contrast-125"
            aria-label="Grotesque crosshatched pen-and-ink illustration of a Dread Knight in skeletal armor."
            style='background-image: url("https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/aida-public/AB6AXuAKNzjFJmyyAubw75N8PkgeIzleC5ayxs64PjCxfaFXeW-Ak1CSH0oGsFNw5XBKMX1Bl7E7rUJhcQ5vo_p1Sup5KxoqHknA8ZZELdjoVwpHlUbfLdmTFr59OA5LB_6WlmPHfDZvJyYpCY5NnrX_rnsw3qnsO9xIENlFMrupVYLrM6oiOyitkA9HOkyJyftv6cN9M72-4ufzGV6Y-wcP68YPt-WptTx9SfRQjaKC5npPCiwJNR-W50qNPfggVm6gNrE31ygOG-diAPoK");'
          >
          </div>
        </div>
        <!-- Text & Table Column -->
        <div class="col-span-12 md:col-span-7 flex flex-col">
          <div class="p-8 border-b-2 border-primary bg-background-light">
            <h3
              class="font-display text-2xl font-black uppercase mb-6 underline decoration-4 underline-offset-8"
            >
              Origin and Etiquette
            </h3>
            <div
              class="columns-1 md:columns-2 gap-8 text-lg leading-relaxed justified-slab text-primary/90"
            >
              <p class="mb-4">
                The Dread Knight emerges not from a womb, but from the frigid
                sepulchers of the Forgotten Reach. They are the spectral echoes
                of fallen paladins, their noble vows twisted by the necrotic
                resonance of the Void. To behold a Dread Knight is to gaze into
                the history of lost empires, for their armor is etched with the
                genealogies of kings long turned to dust.
              </p>
              <p class="mb-4">
                They follow a rigid code known as the 'Liturgy of the Still
                Heart.' It is a series of seventy-seven mandates that govern
                their every movement, from the weight of their stride to the
                angle at which they must offer their sword to a superior. In the
                company of mortals, they remain silent, their presence marked
                only by the smell of ancient parchment and ozone.
              </p>
              <p>
                Their weapon is an extension of their very soul—or what remains
                of it. Each kill feeds the blade, and each drop of blood spilled
                serves to lubricate the grinding gears of their eternal
                existence. They seek not glory, but the eventual peace that
                comes only with the total dissolution of the world.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Stats Section -->
          <div class="p-8 flex-1 bg-white/10">
            <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-start">
              <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
                <h4
                  class="font-mono font-bold text-lg uppercase mb-4 tracking-tighter"
                >
                  I. Starting Stats (Standard)
                </h4>
                <table
                  class="w-full font-mono text-sm rigid-table border-collapse bg-white"
                >
                  <thead class="bg-primary text-background-light">
                    <tr>
                      <th class="text-left font-bold uppercase">Attribute</th>
                      <th class="text-right font-bold uppercase">Value</th>
                    </tr>
                  </thead>
                  <tbody>
                    <tr>
                      <td class="uppercase">Strength</td>
                      <td class="text-right">18 / 00</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td class="uppercase">Wits</td>
                      <td class="text-right">09 / 14</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td class="uppercase">Vigor</td>
                      <td class="text-right">16 / 99</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td class="uppercase">Agility</td>
                      <td class="text-right">07 / 22</td>
                    </tr>
                    <tr>
                      <td class="uppercase">Necromancy</td>
                      <td class="text-right">12 / 05</td>
                    </tr>
                  </tbody>
                </table>
              </div>
              <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
                <h4
                  class="font-display font-black text-lg uppercase mb-4 tracking-tight border-b-2 border-primary pb-1"
                >
                  Special Abilities
                </h4>
                <ul class="font-serif text-base space-y-3 italic">
                  <li>
                    — <span class="font-bold not-italic"
                      >Bone-Shatter Grasp:</span
                    > Deals 2d10 crushing damage + paralyzes living tissue for 1 turn.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    — <span class="font-bold not-italic"
                      >Aura of the Damned:</span
                    > All allies within 10ft gain +2 to armor class; enemies must
                    roll vs. Fear.
                  </li>
                  <li>
                    — <span class="font-bold not-italic">Spectral Steed:</span> Summon
                    a mount of pure shadow for 1 hour per character level.
                  </li>
                </ul>
              </div>
            </div>
            <!-- Bottom Slab Text -->
            <div
              class="mt-8 pt-8 border-t-2 border-primary/20 text-sm justified-slab opacity-80 leading-snug"
            >
              <p>
                Note to players: The Dread Knight is a high-difficulty class.
                Their inability to heal through standard clerical prayers makes
                them reliant on soul-leeching mechanisms found only in the
                darker reaches of the spellbook. Exercise extreme caution when
                entering consecrated grounds, as the holy resonance will cause
                1d4 psychic damage per turn.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </main>
    </div>
    <!-- Footer Stripe -->
    <footer
      class="bg-primary text-background-light px-8 py-2 flex justify-between items-center font-mono text-[10px] uppercase tracking-widest"
    >
      <span>The Tome © 1974 - 1979 Chronos Systems</span>
      <span>Page 112 of 666</span>
      <span>Registered User: ADMIN_01</span>
    </footer>
  </div>
</Layout>
